#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:40011
#: 71dfe24390414c02aa790aed8b4eeb38
msgid ""
"A linear Bruco scan will **not** detect bilinear coupling because the "
"witness channels are individually incoherent with DARM — only their "
"*product* is."
msgstr ""
"線形 Bruco では個々のウィットネスチャンネルと DARM の直接コヒーレンスは低く、 バイリニアカップリングは**検出されません**。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:40014
#: 7939b7594daf426aabdf8013d63bf0ed
msgid ""
"**Common mistake**: concluding that \"no coherence\" means \"no coupling\" "
"after only the baseline scan. For bilinear problems, the failure of the "
"linear witness is the expected diagnostic, not a negative result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:70002
#: 6964521efc0d4508a46b05e86eb02199
msgid "2. Linear Bruco Scan (Baseline)"
msgstr "2. 線形 Bruco スキャン（ベースライン）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:70004
#: 537f22e29a7944239c8780859e233c9b
msgid ""
"Run the standard Bruco coherence scan with the two individual witnesses. The"
" bilinear coupling between them and DARM should remain invisible here."
msgstr "2 つのウィットネスチャンネルで通常の線形コヒーレンススキャンを実行します。 バイリニアカップリングはここでは見えないことを確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:90002
#: 125ba24e51254ca5b72a539131d773e1
msgid "3. Bilinear Coupling Detection"
msgstr "3. バイリニアカップリング検出"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:90004
#: a22f166ad54843c29b2b34a4a8ad202e
msgid ""
"**Recipe** (from O4b DARM-116 Hz and IMMT bilinear commissioning analyses):"
msgstr "**レシピ**（O4b DARM 116 Hz 解析・IMMT バイリニアコミッショニング解析より）:"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:90012
#: a26bdee4347b41a1b130ecac59c5a2ad
msgid ""
"This synthetic channel mimics the product nonlinearity inside the "
"interferometer. If DARM contains `fast × slow`, the bilinear witness will be"
" highly coherent with it."
msgstr ""
"この合成チャンネルは干渉計内部の積型非線形性を模擬します。 DARM が `fast × slow` "
"を含む場合、バイリニアウィットネスとの高いコヒーレンスが現れます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:90015
#: 549e836cf5e94b908ed365ddc10ce505
msgid "We then pass this extended channel set back to `Bruco.compute()`."
msgstr "拡張チャンネルセットを `Bruco.compute()` に渡して再スキャンします。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:90017
#: 073516d5e97a4d4b963f871515351b6b
msgid ""
"**Failure-prone pattern**: using an overly broad slow-band or leaving DC "
"trends in the fast witness. Both choices smear the product witness and often"
" create impressive-looking but non-local coherence. Keep the slow witness "
"tied to the modulation band you expect physically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:120002
#: 1e241909c61a4a26b53a4e3447f9ad36
msgid "4. Hilbert AM/FM Demodulation"
msgstr "4. Hilbert AM/FM 復調"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:120004
#: 7b7b110b1166470c93dfee1bf499e62f
msgid ""
"When a spectral line is amplitude- or frequency-modulated by a slow "
"environmental perturbation, the line's *carrier* frequency shows no direct "
"coherence with the slow channel — but the **envelope** does."
msgstr ""
"スペクトル線がゆっくりした環境擾乱で振幅変調（AM）または周波数変調（FM）されている場合、 "
"キャリア周波数と低速チャンネルの**直接コヒーレンスはゼロ**です。しかし、 **包絡線**は高いコヒーレンスを持ちます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:120008
#: 2c0219cdcfe74756864d525b78fab90c
msgid "**Recipe** (from O4c PEM injection shaker analyses):"
msgstr "**レシピ**（O4c PEM injection シェーカー解析より）:"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:120017
#: a06910313e414b5e86fcb34df5da071d
msgid ""
"We then correlate `inst_amp` and `inst_freq` with slow auxiliary channels to"
" identify what is driving the amplitude / frequency modulation."
msgstr "`inst_amp` および `inst_freq` を低速補助チャンネルと相関させ、 変調源を特定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:120020
#: 715d6ce0dcd941f78b0d58194b72aeb3
msgid ""
"**Common mistake**: correlating the raw carrier ASD with the slow witness "
"and stopping there. AM/FM problems usually live in the envelope or "
"instantaneous-frequency channel, not in the carrier bin itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:140002
#: a6faa9514dfe48a8891ec0b2637869b8
msgid "5. AM/FM Coherence with Slow Witnesses"
msgstr "5. AM/FM と低速ウィットネスのコヒーレンス"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:140004
#: de258dcd20a34f6aaa4933488af951d5
msgid ""
"The Hilbert envelope (`inst_amp`) and instantaneous frequency (`inst_freq`) "
"have their own ASD in the modulation frequency range (0 – 5 Hz here). We "
"compute coherence of these signals with slow environmental witnesses to "
"identify the modulation source."
msgstr ""
"Hilbert 包絡線（`inst_amp`）と瞬時周波数（`inst_freq`）は 変調周波数帯域（ここでは 0 – 5 Hz）に独自の ASD "
"を持ちます。 これらと低速環境チャンネルのコヒーレンスを計算し、変調源を特定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:140009
#: 46e47aa836324379be4567f743f2add4
msgid ""
"**Failure mode to watch for**: if the band-pass around the carrier is too "
"wide, neighbouring lines leak into the analytic signal; if it is too narrow,"
" the demodulated envelope is artificially suppressed. Tune the carrier "
"window to isolate one physical line family."
msgstr ""

