#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160014
#: 1df999ae50e1409fa53bc7f271787734
msgid ""
"**Linear Bruco is not sufficient** when coupling has the form `DARM ≈ f_fast"
" × f_slow`. Building a synthetic `fast × slow` witness restores coherence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160016
#: 38d95b7fb6794e6e90e7b6d4eae39e1e
msgid ""
"**Hilbert demodulation** decouples the carrier (high frequency) from the "
"modulation (low frequency), enabling coherence searches in the modulation "
"band."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160018
#: c67d7e4fcedc4427b5944700bb8c7c4a
msgid ""
"Both patterns require only `TimeSeries` arithmetic (`*`, `.highpass()`, "
"`.bandpass()`) plus `Bruco.compute()` — no additional gwexpy modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160020
#: 2a31efc55cbc44c8a0cdf401f07b9194
msgid ""
"Failure of the baseline linear scan is itself useful evidence when the "
"expected physics is multiplicative or slowly modulated."
msgstr "期待される物理が積型や低速変調なら、ベースライン線形スキャンの失敗自体が重要な手掛かりになる。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160022
#: 20bab50dfd6c4282b19bb7cea682c3d5
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "次のステップ"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160024
#: 02dd5a0b2af640a8b1c7f388a817d326
msgid "Replace mock data with real NDS/GWF channels (`TimeSeries.read()`)."
msgstr "実データは `TimeSeries.read()` で NDS/GWF から読み込む。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_bruco_advanced.ipynb:160025
#: f7d331cfab59484e90560cec7704db45
msgid ""
"Extend the bilinear search to all `(ch_fast, ch_slow)` pairs systematically."
msgstr "バイリニアスキャンを全 `(ch_fast, ch_slow)` ペアに系統的に拡張する。"

